      "blockKey": "context",
      "text": "The Reaper had been arranging the surviving details into a portrait of the friend before the breaking. Every match seemed useful; every difference seemed another injury to remove. Then the habit of making room returned within the merged recollection, alongside a resistance he could not attribute with the same confidence.",
      "mode": "SILENT_HANDWRITING",
